{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1478134,\"title\":\"KSW 106\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"XTB KSW 106 event took on May 10, 2025, at LDLC Arena in Lyon, France, promoted by Konfrontacja Sztuk Walki (KSW). The main event features Salahdine Parnasse defending his KSW Lightweight Championship against Marian Ziółkowski, with Parnasse coming off a knockout win over Wilson Varela at KSW 101 and Ziółkowski stepping in after Marcin Held’s injury withdrawal. The co-main event pits Olympic wrestling medalist Damian Janikowski against Laïd Zerhouni in a middleweight clash. Other notable bouts include Alioune Nahaye vs. Piotr Kacprzak in featherweight and Aymard Guih vs. Mateusz Makarowski in lightweight, part of a nine-fight card emphasizing France vs. Poland matchups.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fUijITjgMzTAIw82ep27qNJ6R6Q.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/12xaAwwsd67mFNNBAgIGSyRDigr.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2025,\"runtime\":0,\"genres\":[],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"FR\",\"name\":\"France\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":4095535,\"name\":\"Salahdine Parnasse\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bsUh04kS8k6FVGDcPkpN3VWVIPA.jpg\"},{\"id\":4095532,\"name\":\"Marian Ziółkowski\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4433965,\"name\":\"Damian Janikowski\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qv36tVcHVrF0eFOPPhfvPiuRcZ8.jpg\"},{\"id\":3324902,\"name\":\"Laid Zerhouni\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3769658,\"name\":\"Amin Ayoub\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/j8rghH8SS60Hbacwc8NpQwRaF5E.jpg\"},{\"id\":2951098,\"name\":\"Mickaël Lebout\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vwuYuxA4ng09crkb3qgvW9TQEH4.jpg\"},{\"id\":4074244,\"name\":\"Aymard Guih\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5432523,\"name\":\"Mateusz Makarowski\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3899118,\"name\":\"Alioune Nahaye\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4564725,\"name\":\"Piotr Kacprzak\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4902078,\"name\":\"Michal Guzik\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3942406,\"name\":\"Joël Kouadja\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5124264,\"name\":\"Amaury Wako-Zabo\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4935058,\"name\":\"Kacper Fornalski\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4902080,\"name\":\"Krystian Blezien\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1648226,\"title\":\"UFC Freedom 250: Topuria vs. Gaethje\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9bkunLw8kI13A7aPIjduoUleQ9b.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d7kMVeYIFlX5y2fp0pnrBvm9Evx.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"UFC Freedom 250: Topuria vs. Gaethje (also known as UFC White House) was a mixed martial arts event produced by the Ultimate Fighting Championship that took place on June 14, 2026, on the South Lawn of the White House in Washington, D.C., United States.  The event's name is a reference to the America 250th anniversary in the United States. A UFC Lightweight Championship title unification bout between current champion and former UFC Featherweight Champion Ilia Topuria and current two-time interim champion (also a former WSOF Lightweight Champion) Justin Gaethje headlined the event\",\"genres\":[\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":476853,\"title\":\"Tough Guys\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sq5UDkTLGrEVpBiF8zaQTqWYMJv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gXQj9BJJt832Y18WPY6ZETx2jpn.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"10 years before the debut of the Ultimate Fighting Championship.  In 1979, Bill Viola and Frank Caliguri dreamed up a contest pitting barroom bigmouths against wrestlers, martial artists, boxers, bouncers and brawlers, billed as no-holds-barred new type of competitive fighting. When the fights succeeded beyond their wildest expectations, they were swept up in a chain of events that ended in the first mixed-martial arts ban in the nation.  “Tough Guys” chronicles the inception of Caliguri and Viola’s first bouts and the colorful, crazy cast of fighters who made them a hit as well as the politicians who brought it all crashing down. The film brings to life a moment when the national martial arts craze was building to a crescendo as the economies of Pennsylvania steel towns were plummeting to levels of unemployment never seen, breeding desperate men looking for a chance to prove their worth and make some money in the ring.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":475996,\"title\":\"UFC Fight Night 116: Rockhold vs. Branch\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/j7L4WegfdeRRfQNiPd3ANwCD9mm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7fQuLAMvTw6SvQad6sZGPwMJxS4.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"UFC Fight Night 116: Rockhold vs. Branch was a mixed martial arts event produced by the Ultimate Fighting Championship held on September 16, 2017 at the PPG Paints Arena in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania. A middleweight bout between former Strikeforce and UFC Middleweight Champion Luke Rockhold and former WSOF Middleweight and Light Heavyweight Champion David Branch headlined this event.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1455576,\"title\":\"UFC on ESPN 66: Machado Garry vs. Prates\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1QwNcc1FS8GzVbno8KzxCE5XbVw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yTUpq0Tp9xJ81m5EhKn7ycXJRY6.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"UFC on ESPN 66: Machado Garry vs. Prates was a mixed martial arts event produced by the Ultimate Fighting Championship that took place on April 26, 2025, at the T-Mobile Center in Kansas City, Missouri, United States. A welterweight bout between Ian Machado Garry and Carlos Prates served as the event headliner.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":25287,\"title\":\"UFC 105: Couture vs. Vera\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3aPQvweGTcwDUXitocc1gkTctIl.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":5.2,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"UFC 105: Couture vs. Vera was a mixed martial arts event held by the Ultimate Fighting Championship (UFC) on November 14, 2009 in Manchester, England at the Manchester Evening News Arena. This event aired on the same day, via tape delay, on Spike in the U.S.\",\"genres\":[],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1650937,\"title\":\"RIZIN LANDMARK 13 in FUKUOKA\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gFJL9ROoCA0EcJfBHv1TCcrjX41.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oRZzqYcz3tNNutqi0SwnHIwQt3a.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Kubo challenges the undisputed champion Sheidlaev! Haginiwa Kyohei and Horie Yoshinori aim for a comeback!\",\"genres\":[\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"dbyzl-QFZ9c\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"2hntFcokL44\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"WjQ7hH0xkoo\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}